  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "What is the Acquisition.com Scaling Workshop?",
      "fontFamily": "Poppins, \"Poppins Fallback\"",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 165,
      "y": 1937,
      "w": 1095,
      "h": 54
    },
    {
      "text": "It's not an event. It's a workshop. At my office.",
      "fontFamily": "Poppins, \"Poppins Fallback\"",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 165,
      "y": 2001,
      "w": 1095,
      "h": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "Expect zero motivational talks. Meaning - we get tactical.",
      "fontFamily": "Poppins, \"Poppins Fallback\"",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 165,
      "y": 2028,
      "w": 1095,
      "h": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "On day one, we break down how we fast track growth, recruit top talent, and frameworks we use for \"high return\" decision making.",
      "fontFamily": "Poppins, \"Poppins Fallback\"",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 165,
      "y": 2055,
      "w": 1095,
      "h": 54
    },
    {
      "text": "This is the same stuff we use in our portfolio.",
      "fontFamily": "Poppins, \"Poppins Fallback\"",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 165,
      "y": 2109,
      "w": 1095,
      "h": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "On day two, we get hands on. We separate into small groups.",
      "fontFamily": "Poppins, \"Poppins Fallback\"",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 165,
      "y": 2136,
      "w": 1095,
      "h": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "You meet with our directors (specialized in marketing, sales, people, profit, and strategy) to get personalized help.",
      "fontFamily": "Poppins, \"Poppins Fallback\"",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 165,
      "y": 2163,
      "w": 1095,
      "h": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "How to register for a workshop",
      "fontFamily": "Poppins, \"Poppins Fallback\"",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 165,
      "y": 2001,
      "w": 1095,
      "h": 54
    },
    {
      "text": "To register for the Acquisition.com Scaling Workshop, we require you to meet minimum requirements. Our Workshop Sales Team would love to talk to you about those requirements. Click here to get started",
      "fontFamily": "Poppins, \"Poppins Fallback\"",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 165,
      "y": 2065,
      "w": 1095,
      "h": 54
    },
    {
      "text": "Who is the right fit for a workshop?",
      "fontFamily": "Poppins, \"Poppins Fallback\"",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 165,
      "y": 2065,
      "w": 1095,
      "h": 54
    },
    {
      "text": "To determine if you are the right fit for the Acquisition.com Scaling Workshop, book a call to speak with a member of our workshop concierge team. We require you to meet some minimum entry requirement",
      "fontFamily": "Poppins, \"Poppins Fallback\"",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 165,
      "y": 2129,
      "w": 1095,
      "h": 108
    },
    {
      "text": "Who are the main speakers?",
      "fontFamily": "Poppins, \"Poppins Fallback\"",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 165,
      "y": 2129,
      "w": 1095,
      "h": 54
    },
    {
      "text": "You will be introduced to the team that actively runs our portfolio. In addition, on the second day, you can look forward to breakout sessions with Acquisition.com subject matter experts so that no qu",
      "fontFamily": "Poppins, \"Poppins Fallback\"",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 165,
      "y": 2193,
      "w": 1095,
      "h": 81
    }
