  "fullText": "Skip to main content\nNEW\nNew 2026 Workshops Announced: See the workshops\nWorkshops\nEducation\nMedia\nPartner With Us\nAbout the Firm\nCareers\nReady To Scale\nDO YOU WANT TO SCALE YOUR BUSINESS?\nLearn from the team that has scaled a portfolio to over $250m+ in annual revenue.\nI'M READY TO SCALE\n10,000\nBUSINESSES ADVISED\n81\nNPS\n97.1%\nCLIENT RETENTION\n12,000\nWORKSHOP PARTICIPANTS\nBRAND NEW\n$100M SCALING ROADMAP\nGET MY CUSTOM SCALING ROADMAP\nFREE ADVANCED TRAINING\nVideos, eBooks, Guides, Templates, Downloads & more to help you succeed:\nNew Release\n$100M MONEY MODELS\nTake This Course\nIt's Free\nOFFER CREATION COURSE\nTake This Course\nIt's Free\nLEAD GENERATION COURSE\nTake This Course\nLive In-Person\nSCALING WORKSHOP\nAttend a Workshop\nFAQs\n\nWhat is the Acquisition.com Scaling Workshop?\n\nIt's not an event. It's a workshop. At my office.\n\nExpect zero motivational talks. Meaning - we get tactical.\n\nOn day one, we break down how we fast track growth, recruit top talent, and frameworks we use for \"high return\" decision making.\n\nThis is the same stuff we use in our portfolio.\n\nOn day two, we get hands on. We separate into small groups.\n\nYou meet with our directors (specialized in marketing, sales, people, profit, and strategy) to get personalized help.\n\nHow to register for a workshop\n\nTo register for the Acquisition.com Scaling Workshop, we require you to meet minimum requirements. Our Workshop Sales Team would love to talk to you about those requirements. Click here to get started!\n\nWho is the right fit for a workshop?\n\nTo determine if you are the right fit for the Acquisition.com Scaling Workshop, book a call to speak with a member of our workshop concierge team. We require you to meet some minimum entry requirements to be allowed in the room. These requirements include but are not limited to being active in business, a revenue threshold and operating in an industry where we are confident we can provide value. If this is of interest, book a call today to see if you are the right fit.\n\nWho are the main speakers?\n\nYou will be introduced to the team that actively runs our portfolio. In addition, on the second day, you can look forward to breakout sessions with Acquisition.com subject matter experts so that no question is left unanswered by the time you leave.\n\nABOUT OUR FOUNDERS\nAlex and Leila Hormozi are co-founders and managing partners of Acquisition.com. In four years, the portfolio grew to over $250m+ in annual revenue. Before Acquisition.com they founded Gym Launch, Prestige Labs, and ALAN. In 2021, a private equity sponsor purchased Gym Launch and Prestige Labs for $46.2M. And in that same year, a strategic buyer bought ALAN in an all stock deal.\n\nAlex wrote two best selling books $100M Offers and $100M Leads, both of which have sold over 1M copies and are still #1 & #2 on Amazon for Marketing & Sales.\n\nTheir mission at Acquisition.com is to make real business education accessible to everyone. And to do that, they strive to build a business that improves the lives of everyone it comes in contact with. They built a culture of praise over punishment to make it happen. Alex and Leila have an audience of over 12M+ that subscribe to their business content across social media.\nCOURSES\nScaling Course\nOffers Course\nLeads Course\nMoney Models Course\nMEDIA\nSocials\nPodcast\nBook Speaking Engagements\nABOUT ACQ\nAbout the Firm\nAlex Hormozi\nCareers\nPartner With Us\nEXPLORE\nWorkshops\nBooks\nPrivacy Statement\nTerms and Conditions\nDMCA Policy\nDo Not Sell My Info\nAlex and Leila Hormozi’s results are not typical and are not a guarantee of your success. Alex and Leila are experienced business owners and investors, and your results will vary depending on education, effort, application, experience, and background. Alex and Leila do not personally invest in every business they work with through Acquisition.com, LLC. Due to the sensitivity of financial information, we do not know or track the typical results of our students.  We cannot guarantee that you will make money or that you will be successful if you employ their business strategies specifically or generally. Consequently, your results may significantly vary from theirs. We do not give investment, tax, or other professional advice. Specific transactions and experiences are mentioned for informational purposes only. The information contained within this website is the property of Acquisition.com. Any use of the images, content, or ideas expressed herein without the express written consent of Acquisition.com is prohibited. Copyright © 2026 Acquisition.com, LLC. All Rights Reserved"
